Well, my only win is with a healer. (Used savefiles though, so I really
don't count that as a win)

The best things about healers are:
1) the potions you start with. It's easier to start with about 30 hps...
2) the stethoscope. Really important. Use it and when your hps are lower
   than the monsters, run! (maybe even before that)
3) If you can enchant the scalpel it is actually quite good weapon,
   because you get a extra +2 for hitting.
 
